sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant MobileApp
  participant APIGateway
  participant WorkoutService
  participant AIRecommendationService
  participant DB
  participant ReminderService
  participant NotificationSystem

  User->>MobileApp: Log workout data
  MobileApp->>APIGateway: POST /workouts
  APIGateway->>WorkoutService: Save workout data
  WorkoutService->>DB: Insert workout data
  DB-->>WorkoutService: Acknowledgement
  WorkoutService-->>APIGateway: Success
  APIGateway-->>MobileApp: Success response

  MobileApp->>APIGateway: Request personalized workout recommendations
  APIGateway->>AIRecommendationService: Fetch recommendations
  AIRecommendationService->>DB: Query user workout history
  DB-->>AIRecommendationService: User workout data
  AIRecommendationService-->>APIGateway: Recommendations
  APIGateway-->>MobileApp: Recommendations

  APIGateway->>ReminderService: Schedule reminders for user
  ReminderService->>NotificationSystem: Queue notifications
  NotificationSystem-->>User: Sends reminders/motivational messages